  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Commandante** (1 review): The performance started at album pace but then accelerated to a faster tempo [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Love You. Let's Light Ourselves on Fire**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Un Rêve Plus Long Que la Nuit**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Sign of the Crow 2**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Blueberry Frost**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Marduk T-Shirt Men's Room Incident**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Going to Alaska**: back after 99 archived shows (2324 days); rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Beach House**: back after 104 archived shows (2572 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Emerging**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2009-03-25.mp3192** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 91 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Idle chatter between songs is audible, contributing to the recording's bootleg character [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The audience reaction was criticized, and a disruptive person yelled during the performance [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2009-03-25.mp3192**: The uploader stated they were unsure how they originally acquired the recording [1]",
